{
    "id":  11754,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "LED Strip 24V RGBIC | SMD5050 DIGITAL | 5m | 60 LED/m | 12W/M | IP20 | Cut 1.7cm",
    "reference":  "SP60D12W-RGB-91447",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eIlluminate your spaces with the \u003cb\u003eRGBIC SMD5050 24V Digital LED Strip\u003c/b\u003e, an advanced solution that offers individual control of each LED to create dynamic effects and vibrant colors. With \u003cstrong\u003e60 LED/m\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003e12W/m\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e120Lm/W\u003c/strong\u003e efficiency. \u003cstrong\u003eIP20\u003c/strong\u003e design, \u003cstrong\u003e8mm\u003c/strong\u003e width, cut every \u003cstrong\u003e1.7cm\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes \u003cstrong\u003e3M\u003c/strong\u003e adhesive tape for quick installation. Compatible with \u003cstrong\u003e92110-SPIR3 controller\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e92111-C6 remote\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eLED Strip 24V RGBIC | DIGITAL SMD5050 | 5m | 60LED/m | 12W/m | IP20\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eDiscover our innovative RGBIC SMD5050 DIGITAL 12W LED Strip!\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e This revolutionary model takes decorative lighting to the next level with \u003cstrong\u003eRGBIC technology\u003c/strong\u003e, allowing you to \u003cstrong\u003econtrol each LED individually\u003c/strong\u003e to create dynamic effects, smooth gradients, and multicolor transitions impossible with conventional RGB strips.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith a \u003cstrong\u003etotal power of 12W/m (4W red, 4W green, 4W blue)\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e120Lm/W efficiency\u003c/strong\u003e, it delivers \u003cstrong\u003ebright, powerful, and energy-efficient lighting\u003c/strong\u003e. Featuring \u003cstrong\u003e60 LEDs per meter\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003e8mm width\u003c/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong\u003ecut every 1.7cm\u003c/strong\u003e, it offers almost unlimited flexibility for indoor lighting projects.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eRGBIC SMD 24V DIGITAL LED Strip\u003c/strong\u003e includes \u003cstrong\u003e3M adhesive tape\u003c/strong\u003e for a \u003cstrong\u003equick, strong, and clean installation\u003c/strong\u003e on any flat surface. Its \u003cstrong\u003eIP20 rating\u003c/strong\u003e makes it ideal for \u003cstrong\u003eindoor use\u003c/strong\u003e, providing vivid colors and immersive effects for residential, commercial, or artistic spaces.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFully \u003cstrong\u003ecompatible with the 92110-SPIR3 controller\u003c/strong\u003e and the \u003cstrong\u003e92111-C6 remote\u003c/strong\u003e, it offers \u003cstrong\u003ecomplete and intuitive control\u003c/strong\u003e over your lighting environment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Benefits\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUnlimited customization:\u003c/strong\u003e Cut every 1.7cm to fit your needs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBright and efficient:\u003c/strong\u003e 12W/m and 24V ensure steady performance.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEasy installation:\u003c/strong\u003e 3M adhesive for secure mounting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh compatibility:\u003c/strong\u003e Works with 92110-SPIR3 and 92111-C6.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDynamic RGBIC effects:\u003c/strong\u003e Independent LED control for unique patterns.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApplications\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAmbient lighting:\u003c/strong\u003e Create warm or vibrant atmospheres.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEvents and parties:\u003c/strong\u003e Add dynamic, festive lighting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInterior design:\u003c/strong\u003e Highlight furniture and architecture.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisplays and signage:\u003c/strong\u003e Ideal for commercial illumination.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLight art:\u003c/strong\u003e Perfect for creative and artistic installations.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003ePower supply NOT included\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt FactorLED we ensure that our products have a QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"gtx-trans\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gtx-trans-icon\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
